Cost, I&#39;d imagine. &nbsp;The retail on the Oversized Villain Packs is &nbsp;$15, and an Oversized Hero Pack would be at least twice the number of cards, not to mention the graphic design/overlay. &nbsp;So I&#39;d expect the MSRP of that to be around that of a full expansion or more and I don&#39;t know if the profit margin would be worth it to print it. &nbsp;Also, the villains almost need the Oversized because they have so much text whereas the heroes just have their power and incaps.
